  "review": "Timer registration EAX stored EBP and frame24 at E2A46C/E2A470. Facing temporarily reuses EBP, so SetTimer and some cleanup use frame24; backedge reloads EBP. CD4470 is the CTimer destructor and calls DeregisterTimer with *this. All native exit paths after registration dispose the same timer once, checked by CFG. StartScripting binds self EDI(this+8) to frame64 priority4. Both facing calls target self and snap false; the initial lookup consumes8 bytes leaving EBXzero as facing snap argument. Termination AL is captured immediately at entry and loop bottom. Controlled-resource and movie lifetimes remain unresolved."
